_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\">IMO Problems and Solutions</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Resources_for_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=23\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_scholarships\" title=\"Mathematics scholarships\">Mathematics scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_competitions\" title=\"Science competitions\">Science competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Informatics_competitions\" title=\"Informatics competitions\">Informatics competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018012032\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.084 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 291/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1913/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 274/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   23.983      1 -total\n 94.73%   22.719      5 Template:Main\n 64.15%   15.384      5 Template:Hatnote\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1445:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018012032 and revision id 293127. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}